  "description": "Test build of Kindred as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): Mark of the Kindred hunts - every 75 s Lamb names an enemy champion she has not fought in the last 6 s (a mark over him, live after 8 s); a takedown on the hunted champion gives a mark (not again on him for 240 s), and her marks stay through death - instead of the data pack's mark for any champion takedown, lost on death. And her R goes out only when an allied champion in her circle - a teammate or Kindred herself - is about to die (below 30% health, or 30% lost within a second, with an enemy champion close), read from their health. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
